                                <enumeratedValue>
                                    <name>1</name>
                                    <description>RX FIFO mode: RX interrupt generated at the end of every received message storage TX FIFO mode: TX interrupt generated for every successfully transmitted message GW FIFO mode: For RX interrupt flag: Interrupt generated when a message is stored in the FIFO For TX interrupt flag: Interrupt generated when a message is successfully transmitted from the FIFO </description>
