                        </field>
                        <field>
                            <name>QUEUE_MASK</name>
                            <description>1-bit per queue indicating from which queues a frame is transmitted from the ports indicated by PORT_MASK. A single frame is transmitted per indicated port in PORT_MASK among the queues indicated by QUEUE_MASK.</description>
