                                    <description>Count-up status of RTCA0SECC, RTCA0MINC, RTCA0HOURC, RTCA0WEEKC, RTCA0DAYC, RTCA0MONC, RTCA0YEARC</description>
                                    <value>#0</value>
                                </enumeratedValue>
                                <enumeratedValue>
                                    <name>1</name>
                                    <description>Count-up stopped status of RTCA0SECC, RTCA0MINC, RTCA0HOURC, RTCA0WEEKC, RTCA0DAYC, RTCA0MONC, RTCA0YEARC (count-up operation of second, minute, hour, week, day, month, and year count registers is stopped)</description>
                                    <value>#1</value>
